{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big判X：X的大块直接交代人物此刻的状态、原因和心理转折，单看大字也能串起完整故事；Y有些关键因果和互相需要的关系落在小字里。small、core、concise判Y：Y的小字更多是在补充新的体验和情境，X则多次用感受重复大字已经说过的意思；Y对幸福与失去无法分开的核心表达也更集中，尤其S13的「幸福没有消失，悲伤却进了幸福里面」，整体更少绕回原意。human、fine判X：Y有「身体仿佛可以交给船底托举」这样的搭配生硬，也有「美也没有消失；可你已经听见时间正在经过」的视角突然转换和不自然表达；X的感受更常落在观众具体的亲近、犹豫、舍不得和身体体验上，Y则有不少感受文字转去描写音乐本身。load判Y：Y的大字短语较短，切分清楚；X不少屏幕要扫完两三段较长的大块，尤其S05只有18秒，却要阅读三段长文字。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7037a6ae-94cc-436a-bc26-e137581cfeb7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T005128407896Z", "elapsed_seconds": 131.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T00:53:39.728316+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "14ee89b06459de59cdeb65027ebc8d87c399706b17aa11721f8e26fd877b4fc8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41